        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003050/extras/b0714007937511d42f9920ae1ace0a76.avif?t=1767075908\" width=625 height=260 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FARM THE UNTHINKABLE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this robo-apocalypse, you don't grow food—you grow technology to survive.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plant Mechanical Marvels:</strong> Sow seeds that sprout into gears, wooden planks, and glowing bulbs. Watch them bloom in satisfying animations!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003050/extras/ea183b3c17e23573f7a364dd1d35f344.poster.avif?t=1767075908\" width=604 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003050/extras/ea183b3c17e23573f7a364dd1d35f344.webm?t=1767075908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003050/extras/ea183b3c17e23573f7a364dd1d35f344.mp4?t=1767075908\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mutate for Power:</strong> Research crop mutations—turn a basic battery plant into a high-capacity energy source.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Automate &amp; Craft:</strong> Harvest resources, synthesize tools, and build machines to run your farm on autopilot.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003050/extras/6a7c411ae4b9d688f798a078218af699.poster.avif?t=1767075908\" width=600 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003050/extras/6a7c411ae4b9d688f798a078218af699.webm?t=1767075908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003050/extras/6a7c411ae4b9d688f798a078218af699.mp4?t=1767075908\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UPGRADE YOURSELF</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your farm powers you. Evolve from a lost bot into a wasteland legend.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Permanent Robo-Upgrades:</strong> Mine ores and fish for mutants, then install upgrades like Energy Storage, Remote Control, or Instant Teleportation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Cozy Den:</strong> Transform a dingy cave into a personalized oasis. Fence plots, add benches, decorate with adventure loot, and construct processing machines.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003050/extras/743c043398602a282a64446904e47372.poster.avif?t=1767075908\" width=600 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003050/extras/743c043398602a282a64446904e47372.webm?t=1767075908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003050/extras/743c043398602a282a64446904e47372.mp4?t=1767075908\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE THE FORGOTTEN WORLD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The surface is dangerous, but the rewards are worth it.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ruins &amp; Realms:</strong> Delve into crumbling desert towns, storm-swept oases, and the towering Eternal City.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003050/extras/b4c52f9da4892d515b5c33937ca64846.poster.avif?t=1767075908\" width=604 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003050/extras/b4c52f9da4892d515b5c33937ca64846.webm?t=1767075908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003050/extras/b4c52f9da4892d515b5c33937ca64846.mp4?t=1767075908\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Robot Encounters:</strong> Befriend quirky allies for quests and knowledge... or scrap hostile ones blocking your path.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unravel the Mystery:</strong> Why did humanity vanish? Piece together Robert's hidden past in a heartfelt story.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003050/extras/58c50e8c0f31e057bb47f4e9f98fffa8.poster.avif?t=1767075908\" width=600 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003050/extras/58c50e8c0f31e057bb47f4e9f98fffa8.webm?t=1767075908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003050/extras/58c50e8c0f31e057bb47f4e9f98fffa8.mp4?t=1767075908\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003050/extras/bc6537de6b32fd0327739480f9c8e6e1.avif?t=1767075908\" width=625 height=260 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >VERIFIED ON STEAM DECK</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003050/extras/756a447b9f635550f2554bf1f73fcf60.avif?t=1767075908\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>",
